{"data":{"body":"[P2] Upgrade Testing SDK before installing Core 3\n\nFor applications pinned to Testing SDK 1.3.1, the first command requests Core 3 while retaining a testing package whose peer range excludes it. npm rejects that install with `ERESOLVE`, leaving Core and OTel unupgraded even if the next command succeeds. Install Testing SDK 1.3.2 first: its widened peer range supports both Core 2 and Core 3.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs8AAAABA2AS0g","finding_digest":"eecce1b590178b8e3614990ba9f3b7dc67a9275cc09d236a1de404eadd507731","finding_id":"arf_v1_53godnmqc6fy4nqutef2t45x3r","finding_key":"docs/migration-2.x-to-3.0.md::upgrade-dependencies-together::peer-compatible-install-order","identity_key":"docs/migration-2.x-to-3.0.md::upgrade-dependencies-together::peer-compatible-install-order","line":56,"observation_digest":"1c2773070ee43751cbd480108c177f6e48eb0e34f999accb23bc2ba170256fbe","observation_id":"aro_v1_dqtxgbyo4q3vds6uqaiiyf37nz","path":"docs/migration-2.x-to-3.0.md","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-22T17:43:20Z","review_id":"arr_v1_wykhdr2zophosfluy5gkzdkc4d","reviewed_base_sha":"721217ae4ba5674c55da8ff0aee47d8706beb6e2","reviewed_head_sha":"d3aad778605aaf751fc08a169e0d51ab3c5f2726","reviewer":"codex","start_line":54,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_p2n35vbsxu2lc2xtx7ohyaqk5x"},"pull_request":{"number":1047},"record_id":"art_v1_jj6yj53wwcjnk2zawwkly4bmst","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-22T17:43:20Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
